  "summary": "As a software engineer at Informed.IQ, I apply my development skills and my background in business and economics to create innovative solutions for document verification and income analysis. I joined Informed.IQ and worked with clients to understand their needs and challenges, and to design and implement customized solutions using Informed.IQ's platform. I use Python, Ruby, JavaScript, and Typescript to develop and improve the features and functionality of Informed.IQ's products. Before joining Informed.IQ, I was a sales process analyst at LinkedIn for over two years, where I supported the sales team with data analysis, reporting, and optimization. I have a bachelor's degree in business and managerial economics from the University of California, Davis, where I graduated in 2017. I am passionate about leveraging technology to solve real-world problems and to create value for customers and stakeholders. I am also a lifelong learner who is always eager to acquire new skills and knowledge.",
